select null, t.id, 'builtin', 'For a young child, consent for a procedure is usually given by:', '["The child alone","The medical technologist","The parents or legal guardian","Any adult who is present"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Children need someone to represent their interests, and parents are regarded as the appropriate decision-makers for their children. Reference: Children and bioethics: clarifying consent and assent in medical and research settings (pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10075240).', 1, 'verified'
